    character: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 96eb344a6948b4d6d9857fbd42887954, type: 3}
    character2: {fileID: -3929998360153519, guid: 7768e6cd5d1d84ba3b1a2c94654bef5d, type: 3}
    name: Rommel
    soundToPlay: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3eb1024c55ce8430ba259a61060f08e3, type: 3}
    audioPitchOffset: 0
    font: {fileID: 0}
    textSpeed: 0.024
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - "Many times. \r\n"
    - 'When we did not know each other well enough yet, he used to talk to me through
      letters that our peers send to me. '
    - That habit of his was kept until he started abstaining from decisions our fellow
      leaders collectively do.
